Font,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">一行GitHub代码出卖了AMD：Anthropic被曝成其新客户，算力去英伟达化加速</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布AI时代记分卡，引入“有用智能每美元”衡量模型ROI</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek V4正式版实测曝光，或于下周一正式发布对标Kimi K3</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">马斯克称xAI旗下2万亿参数大模型即将完成训练，或挑战Kimi K3性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">特斯拉CEO马斯克宣布，其旗下xAI研发的2万亿参数大模型预计将于下周完成初步训练。该模型性能将显著优于此前的1.5万亿参数版本，并被视为对月之暗面近期发布的Kimi K3大模型的有力挑战。Kimi K3作为目前全球参数规模最大的开源大模型之一，拥有2.8万亿参数、100万词元上下文窗口及原生视觉理解能力，曾在Arena AI前端编程排行榜以1679分登顶。马斯克此前曾公开评价Kimi K3表现令人印象深刻。此次xAI新模型训练进展的披露，标志着全球AI厂商在参数规模、推理能力及开源生态领域的竞争进一步加剧，超大规模基础模型研发已进入新一轮技术博弈阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">工信部发布开源半年报：OpenHarmony设备超13.5亿台，AI开源模型下载破百亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c8da635315c0b9d121af82fddf916dd5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">工信部在国新办发布会上披露2026年上半年软件业发展情况，我国人工智能开源大模型全球累计下载量已突破100亿次。在基础软件领域，OpenHarmony操作系统生态持续扩张，已覆盖手机、汽车、家电等终端，设备累计装机量超过13.5亿台，并衍生出超100款行业发行版。此外，我国工业软件应用深化，重点工业企业数字化研发设计工具普及率达86.3%。工信部表示，下一步将加快出台“人工智能+软件”行动方案，重点培育智能体软件新业态，并持续提升开源基础设施在供应链安全、海外市场落地等方面的能力。目前，国家级人工智能开源社区已汇聚超1100万用户，托管模型超过7万个，标志着中国开源生态已进入全栈构建与规模化应用的新阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">一行GitHub代码出卖了AMD：Anthropic被曝成其新客户，算力去英伟达化加速</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5926909bba1125b1308c52c691359bd1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">一行GitHub代码出卖了AMD：Anthropic被曝成其新客户，算力去英伟达化加速AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jul 20, 202636一行原本不该暴露商业机密的公开代码，把Anthropic的下一手芯片布局捅了出来。据芯片行业分析机构SemiAnalysis解读，AMD AI业务高级总监在GitHub上公开发布的代码里，明确留下了Anthropic将作为AMD客户的痕迹。这桩非官方、非媒体报道的泄露，指向一个清晰的信号：Anthropic正在主动拓宽芯片来源，把算力供应商从单一名单里解放出来。周一，SemiAnalysis在社交平台X上抛出分析帖，结论正来自对AMD那位高级总监公开代码的专业拆解——代码内容直接涉及Anthropic作为AMD客户的相关信息。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布AI时代记分卡，引入“有用智能每美元”衡量模型ROI</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/34e91b0e607a318a17e195c23e79f215.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于7月17日发布AI时代记分卡，提出“有用智能每美元”指标，旨在帮助企业评估AI投入的真实投资回报率（ROI）。该指标超越了传统的Token成本计算，强调通过模型完成任务的实际价值。OpenAI指出，企业应关注任务成功率、人工审核成本及模型推理效率。针对此逻辑，OpenAI推出GPT-5.6系列模型，包含Sol（旗舰）、Terra（平衡）与Luna（高效）三个层级，以适应不同工作流的经济性需求。在DeepSWE v1.1测试中，GPT-5.6 Sol在提升工程任务成功率至72.7%的同时，预估API成本降低了36.2%。OpenAI强调，衡量AI价值的核心在于：随着使用量增长，每一美元投入是否能产出更多高质量、可信赖的实际成果。此举旨在引导行业从关注Token单价转向关注AI在真实工作流中的产出效率</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek V4正式版实测曝光，或于下周一正式发布对标Kimi K3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a325057d23ea1649de77e544020d4b15.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek V4正式版实测视频与演示已在社交平台曝光，预计最早于下周一正式发布。该模型在多项核心指标上表现强劲，实测性能初步达到Claude Opus 4.8水平，并在3D生成能力、Agent行为表现及编码稳健性方面显著提升。在特定游戏代码生成测试中，V4展现出极高性价比，生成3000行代码成本仅为0.12美元，性能表现甚至在部分测试中优于Fable 5与GPT-5.6。交互体验方面，V4优化了思维链（CoT）风格，输出逻辑更简洁，可读性大幅增强。行业分析认为，若V4能以极具竞争力的价格逼近顶流模型水准，将引发新一轮大模型价格战。目前官方尚未最终定档，但下周一的发布时间点符合此前7月中旬的预告节奏。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
